OL,3,AIran says it is 'fully prepared' to
OL,4,Acounter widened US economic sanctions
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran has said it is confident it can
OL,7,Fcounter widened US sanctions after
OL,8,FWashington announced what it described
OL,9,Fas an "economic D-Day" against the
OL,10,Fcountry to try to isolate it from the
OL,11,Fglobal economy.
OL,13,FIranian Economy Minister Ali
OL,14,FMadanizadeh said Tehran was "fully
OL,15,Fprepared" for the sanctions, which he
OL,16,Fsaid would lead to "another defeat" for
OL,17,Fthe US.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
