OL,3,AIran says it is 'fully prepared' to
OL,4,Acounter widened US economic sanctions
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnnouncing a raft of new measures, US
OL,7,FTreasury Secretary Scott Bessent said
OL,8,Fany nation financially partnering with
OL,9,FIran would be isolated, and that banks
OL,10,Fand businesses dealing with Iran would
OL,11,Fshare its isolation if they refused to
OL,12,Fcut ties.
OL,14,FThe moves follow U-turns and extended
OL,15,Fdeadlines from the White House in its
OL,16,Fefforts to end the conflict.
